    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "When a critical failure at a power plant unit plunged the Visayas grid into crisis, the defenders of the grid sounded the alarm to protect the system. Faced with a massive power deficit to overcome, the commanders who acted made the tough call to prevent catastrophic failure, ordering emergency load shedding as a grid stabilization measure. This decisive action, born of a grid incident triggered by equipment failure and compounded by high seasonal demand, ensured the critical transmission line held.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Hero",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The power crisis on the front line of the power crisis began with a unit malfunction, but the system administrator moved decisively. Issuing a red alert, they confronted the ongoing vulnerabilities and relentless demand pressure head-on. Their emergency response, a critical grid management action, prevented a wider collapse despite a significant loss of power capacity, demonstrating the courage required to defend the energy sector entity.",
